    <h1 class="as-title">青岩古镇<span class="as-rating" style="--rating: 5;" aria-label="Rated 4 out of 5"></span></h1>
  </header>

    <p class="as-subtitle">军训结束后的第一个假期我和室友决定抽出一天的时间去一趟青岩古镇</p>

    <figure >
      <img alt="青岩古镇街景" width="302px" height="403px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/qingyanguzhen.JPG" srcset="">
      <figcaption class="fc-cover">古镇中心大街的一个走廊</figcaption>
    </figure>

  <h2>到地先买了杯杨梅汁</h2>
  <h3>成有王记的冰杨梅汁还是比较好喝的，但是我这个买贵了要了我15块钱，往里走随便一个饭店都是10块钱</h3>
   <img alt="青岩古镇的冰杨梅汁" width="260px" height="374px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/bingyangmei.JPG" srcset="">
   <figcaption class="fc-cover">刚解冻的冰杨梅汁</figcaption>

  <h2>赵公专祠门口合影</h2>
  <img alt="赵公专祠门口合影" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/heying1.JPG" srcset="">
  <figcaption class="fc-cover">从左到右依次是：杨林子，杨宗潮，赵荣力，杨兴宇</figcaption>

  <h2>青岩古镇的城墙</h2>
  <h3>这个城墙还是值得爬的，中间有一段很陡，爬着比较刺激，到结尾的时候有一块铁皮挡着路了，后面的景色就看不到了。</h3>
  <td><img alt="青岩古镇城墙" width="520px" height="693px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/chengqiang.JPG" srcset=""></td>
  <td><img alt="在古镇城墙上自拍" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/zipai.JPG" srcset=""></td>
  <figcaption class="fc-cover">城墙脚下</figcaption>
  <h3>从山脚到山顶差不多半个小时的路程，但是有太阳晒着，确实挺难受的</h3>
  <td><img alt="从山上俯瞰青岩古镇" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/quanjing.JPG" srcset=""></td>
  <td><img alt="青岩古镇旅行合照" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/hezhao2.JPG" srcset=""></td>
  <figcaption class="fc-cover">俯瞰整个青岩古镇</figcaption>

  <h2>午饭时间</h2>
  <h3>来了青岩古镇当然少不了一顿特色的猪蹄饭</h3>
  <img alt="青岩古镇特色猪蹄饭" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/fan.JPG" srcset="">
  <figcaption class="fc-cover">左上黄色的是糍粑，下面的是豆腐丸子，中间的是青岩猪蹄，右上是米豆腐做的凉粉，下面那个是拌的猪耳朵，一人点了一碗冰粉。</figcaption>
  <h3>店名金必轩</h3>
  <img alt="金必轩饭店门口" width="520px" height="390px" data-lightbox loading="lazy" src="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20210920/qingyanguzhen/fandian.JPG" srcset="">
